@startuml
title USEI12 – Minimal Backbone Network

actor "Infrastructure Planner" as P
participant "System Controller" as SC
participant "BackboneService" as BS
participant "RailwayNetwork" as G

P -> SC : 1. Request minimal backbone network()
activate SC

SC -> SC : 2. Validate network data\n(ensure loaded)

SC -> BS : 3. computeMinimalBackbone(network)
activate BS

BS -> G : 4. getVerticesAndEdges()
activate G

deactivate G

BS -> BS : 6. Execute MST Algorithm\n(Prim's or Kruskal's)

BS -> BS : 7. Generate DOT format\n(map XY to 'pos' attribute)

BS -> BS : 8. Execute external process\n(run 'neato' for SVG)

BS --> SC : 9. Return MST Graph\nand SVG file path
deactivate BS

SC --> P : 10. Display Backbone visualization (SVG)\nand total track length
deactivate SC


@enduml